(scythe_shop_desc
   "Ever felt like shredding with the souls of the undead? Slice a slick solo, and the goth girls will be screaming for beelzebub."
)
(scythe_desc
   "Ever felt like shredding with the souls of the undead? Slice a slick solo, and the goth girls will be screaming for beelzebub."
)
(guitar_red_octane "RedOctane SG")
(guitar_red_octane_locked_desc
   "It can't be, or maybe it really is? Get five stars on every song on EXPERT to find out."
)
(guitar_red_octane_desc
   "Wait a second, this was really in the game this whole time? Yes it was."
)
(guitar_red_octane_shop_desc
   "Wait a second, this was really in the game this whole time? Yes it was."
)
(dead "Dead!")
(dead_shop_desc
   "To quote Patrick Kolan's review of My Chemical Romance's Sydney Luna Park gig, \qpigeonhole... based... attire\q. Hmm, how about: \qThey're punk with a black taint. It's an image thing\q."
)
(hush "Hush")
(hush_shop_desc
   "\qHush\q was originally written by Joe South, and a version of the song was recorded by Billy Joe Royal a year prior to the release of Deep Purple's cover of the song."
)
(possum "Possum Kingdom")
(possum_shop_desc
   "The song's origins lie in folklore from the band's native state of Texas. Possum Kingdom Lake is a lake in North Texas near Fort Worth."
)
(salvation "Salvation")
(salvation_shop_desc
   "Formed in 1991, Rancid isn't just a clever name. They're also, allegedly, a punk band. Why, allegedly? I don't know, it just felt like an allegedly moment."
)
(lifewasted "Life Wasted")
(lifewasted_shop_desc
   "The lyrics for \qLife Wasted\q were reportedly written about the death of the punk rock guitarist Johnny Ramone and about the feelings one has after driving home from a funeral."
)
(billiondollar "Billion Dollar Babies")
(billiondollar_shop_desc
   "Yes, people say all roads lead to Rome, and that every person on the planet is only a few links away from Kevin Bacon, but up here (I'm tapping my head here), it's all about Alice Cooper."
)
(rockandroll "Rock and Roll Hoochie Koo")
(rockandroll_shop_desc
   "Derringer's solo album, All American Boy was released in '73 with the now already popular \qRock and Roll, Hoochie Koo\q this time as a 'hit' single."
)
(trooper "The Trooper")
(trooper_shop_desc
   "This song is based on the \qCharge of the Light Brigade\q at the Battle of Balaclava 1854, which took place during the Crimean War, and inspired by Lord Tennyson's 1854 poem of the same name."
)
(drinkup "Drink Up")
(drinkup_shop_desc
   "OUNCE of SELF is ready to out-heavy the entire face of this planet! Keeping everything heavy, sludgy, and earth-shaking, the band tends to leave their mark on the metal scene."
)
(kicked "Kicked to the Curb")
(kicked_shop_desc
   "Noble Rot is pure American rock 'n' roll with an extra large side order of PARTY. Founded in 2006, their first full-length album debuts December 7th."
)

(18andlife "18 And Life")
(18andlife_shop_desc
   "If you ever get a life sentence, make sure to get this song in one last time."
)
(aintnothinbut "Ain't Nothin But A Good Time")
(aintnothinbut_shop_desc
   "\qI'm paying you to wash dishes, not listen to that... that rock n roll! Now either get your butt in gear, or you're outta here!\q \n- Your Annoying Manager, circa the 1980s."
)
(ballstothewall "Balls to the Wall")
(ballstothewall_shop_desc
   "One of two songs hailing from Germany, it's Accept's only album to chart in the US and considered an important metal anthem."
)
(ballroomblitz "Ballroom Blitz")
(ballroomblitz_shop_desc
   "This song was written in 1973 by The Sweet based off a time when they were bottled offstage by the crowd. \nHere, it's based off the 1984 cover by Krokus."
)
(bangyourhead "(Bang Your Head) Metal Health")
(bangyourhead_shop_desc
   "Hails from the fisrt heavy metal album to top the Billboard charts.\nMake sure to headbang... if you know the chart by memory."
)
(bathroomwall "Bathroom Wall")
(bathroomwall_shop_desc
   "Written proof that you should call every number seen on a bathroom stall, you could be missing out!"
)
(caughtinamosh "Caught In A Mosh")
(caughtinamosh_shop_desc
   "The album is dedicated to Cliff Burton, who died 6 months earlier while Anthrax was touring with Metallica."
)
(electriceye "Electric Eye")
(electriceye_shop_desc
   "Don't worry, this isn't for your alarm system. Electric Eye is actually two songs, containing the album's intro track The Hellion."
)
(heatofthemoment "Heat Of The Moment")
(heatofthemoment_shop_desc
   "An apology to how the singer acted to a woman he'd later marry... \nthen eventually divorce."
)
(holdonloosely "Hold On Loosely")
(holdonloosely_shop_desc
   "One of the songs played on MTV's debut. The song's lyrics are mainly based off co-writer Jim Peterik's marriage."
)
(holydiver "Holy Diver")
(holydiver_shop_desc
   "Dio was formed by Ronnie James Dio and Vinny Appice of Black Sabbath fame. May Ronnie rock on in peace."
)
(iran "I Ran (So Far Away)")
(iran_shop_desc
   "It gained popularity during the Second British Invasion due to MTV's popularity. In the US, the song rose in popularity due to puns on it's name."
)
(iwannarock "I Wanna Rock")
(iwannarock_shop_desc
   "A parody of this song is featured in The Spongebob Squarepants Movie, performed by Spongebob (voiced by Jim Wise). Dee Snider, singer of Twisted Sister, said quote \n\qGod bless 'SpongeBob SquarePants.'\q"
)
(lonelyisthenight "Lonely Is The Night")
(lonelyisthenight_shop_desc
   "Billy Squier was one of the biggest names of the 80s, gaining frequent rotation on MTV. \nAlso, The closest Harmonix ever will get to including Led Zeppelin."
)
(losangeles "Los Angeles")
(losangeles_shop_desc
   "The song is based off a friend of X who left LA to pursue The Damned's bassist Captain Sensible."
)
(noonelikeyou "No One Like You")
(noonelikeyou_shop_desc
   "German band Scorpions's breakout hit in the US. They always pushed for stardom, having written their lyrics in english despite being based in Germany."
)
(onlyalad "Only A Lad")
(onlyalad_shop_desc
   "Even if you act bad, just know you can count on someone reasoning around why you do it."
)
(playwithme "Play With Me")
(playwithme_shop_desc
   "While their next album was their true claim to fame, \qPlay With Me\q gained some popularity, later appearing in Bill & Ted."
)
(policetruck "Police Truck")
(policetruck_shop_desc
   "Dead Kennedys are one of the biggest early names in the american punk movement with most of their music being satirical takes on authority and pop culture."
)
(radarlove "Radar Love")
(radarlove_shop_desc
   "If you love each other enough, you'll get telepathic powers. While based on the 1989 cover by White Lion, the original was Golden Earring's first international hit back in 1973."
)
(roundandround "Round And Round")
(roundandround_shop_desc
   "The bridge in the song was a late addition suggested by their producer, having been performed live without the bridge prior to the song's release."
)
(seventeen "Seventeen")
(seventeen_shop_desc
   "At least Freezepop knows to act better then Kip Winger. Playing live, ocassionally he'd change the last chorus's first line to more appropriate ages."
)
(shakin "Shakin'")
(shakin_shop_desc
   "Edward Money was born Mahoney, He changed his name to Money in 1968 and would joke about how he was always broke."
)
(synchronicity2 "Synchronicity II")
(synchronicity2_shop_desc
   "Ever wake up a mythical monster just from your own crisis? This song ends out side A of Synchronicity."
)
(turningjapanese "Turning Japanese")
(turningjapanese_shop_desc
   "While they tried to make sure this wouldn't make them a one hit wonder, this is their only song to chart in the Top 5."
)
(thewarrior "The Warrior")
(thewarrior_shop_desc
   "Scandal only ever released one album, falling apart due to conflict within the group and the record labels. Reuniting in the 2000s, A new EP turned album has been promised since 2008, but has yet to be released."
)
(wegotthebeat "We Got the Beat")
(wegotthebeat_shop_desc
   "It was written based off the intro to The Twilight Zone, being a departure from the punk rock sound they had made prior."
)
(whatilikeaboutyou "What I Like About You")
(whatilikeaboutyou_shop_desc
   "The band attempted to sue Activision over the soundalike cover used in-game, believing it infringed their rights for a cover to be used."
)
(wrathchild "Wrathchild")
(wrathchild_shop_desc
   "The songs on Killer were written prior to their debut album and produced by the legendary Martin Birch, who they considered for their debut album, but though they \qweren't worthy.\q"
)
(becauseitsmidnite "Because, It's Midnite")
(becauseitsmidnite_shop_desc
   "Limozeen is Free Country, USA's one and only glam metal pastiche. Larry, Gary, Perry, and Mary, along with live-only members Harry and Terry, are performed live by Matt Chapman, \nJ. Christopher Arrison, and the band Y-O-U."
)
(becauseitsmidnite2 "Because, It's Midnite")
(becauseitsmidnite2_shop_desc
   "Limozeen is Free Country, USA's one and only glam metal pastiche. Larry, Gary, Perry, and Mary, along with live-only members Harry and Terry, are performed live by Matt Chapman, \nJ. Christopher Arrison, and the band Y-O-U."
)


(lag_audio_setting "Audio: %d ms")
(lag_video_setting "Video: %d ms")

(lag_info_howto_manual "Strum up or down to change the offset.")

(lag_audio_test "Audio Test")
(lag_info_howto_audio_test "Strum to the beat of the audible beeps.")

(lag_video_test "Video Test")
(lag_info_howto_video_test "Strum when the circle hits the target.")